<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom says to start share buyback soon.</title>
<headline>Telecom says to start share buyback soon.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Tuesday its share repurchase programme was on track to commence shortly after the announcement of its third quarter result on February 18.</p>
<p>Two brokers have been appointed to commence buying shares in the market on Telecom's behalf -- First NZ Capital and BZW.</p>
</text>
